   "title": "A valve needs surgery (WHEN: see the VALVULAR HEART DISEASE chart): REPAIR or REPLACE, and WITH WHAT?",
   "lines": [
    "LEAKY (regurgitant) → REPAIR · TIGHT (stenotic: calcific aortic, rheumatic mitral) → must be REPLACED",
    "the best valve is your own: every prosthesis can deteriorate, leak, clot or get infected"
